# Exercise the native long-range attack acquisition path without pre-aligning
# Spider-Man at melee distance. SetNextStateId should acquire actor 394 from
# the 1000 cm search cone, select state 87, and commit the authored center-node
# lunge to the gameplay/physics position before the impact is evaluated.
fixed_step_ms 50
sample_interval_ms 25
capture_interval_ms 0
max_time_ms 85000
start_time_ms 53033
render_size 1280 720

wait_gameplay 60000
teleport 14172 -7978 7 -0.416 -0.909 0
move_until_cinematic 14067 -8205 7 71 10000
wait_enemies_active 5000 394 395 397
# Actor 394 stages near (13399,-6484). Approach along the open street's X
# axis; the previous Y-axis fixture crossed the shopping-center planters.
teleport 12599 -6484 10 1 0 0
capture far-attack-acquisition
attack 12000 900 394
capture far-attack-impact
assert_health_above 0
finish
